    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35505" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνηβ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spend one's youth in,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Longus
				3.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of plants,
				<i>flourish in,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάπαισι δ᾽ ἀνθέρικος ἐνηβᾷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					325
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				85.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν jηβώjαις ἵπποις</span> mares
				<i>in the prime of youth,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				5(1).213.15
			</span></i>, al. (Sparta, <span class="entity">v B.C.</span>).</div>
